Product Requirements Document (PRD): Subscription Organizer & Bill Alert

Document Version: 1.0 (MVP)

Target Platform: Android (API 24+)

Technology Stack: Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Firebase (Firestore & FCM)

Project Goal: To provide a simple, reliable, and user-friendly mobile application that alerts users about upcoming subscription renewals, allowing them to make timely cancellation decisions and save money.

1. Goals and Success Metrics

1.1 Core Problem Solved

Users frequently lose track of their recurring bills and auto-renew subscriptions they intended to cancel, leading to unnecessary financial waste.

1.2 Business Goals

Retention: Achieve a 7-day retention rate of 30% after the first notification is triggered.

Adoption: Acquire 100 organic users within the first month of launch.

Monetization Validation (Future): Convert 5% of users who hit the 5-subscription limit to the premium tier upon introducing payment.

1.3 MVP Success Criteria

The application can reliably save, retrieve, and display user-inputted subscription data.

Authentication (sign-in/sign-up) must be seamless and secure using Firebase.

The system must successfully trigger a persistent, actionable notification exactly 7 days before a scheduled renewal date.

The 5-subscription free limit must be correctly enforced.

2. Scope (Minimum Viable Product - MVP)

The MVP will focus on the core value proposition: Tracking + Reliable Notification.

